# Copy to .env.local for `vercel dev`, or set in the Vercel dashboard
# (Project -> Settings -> Environment Variables) for Production/Preview.
# Never commit the real key.

# Required for AI sound generation (api/generate-sound.js), which calls the
# ElevenLabs Sound Effects API. Get one at
# https://elevenlabs.io/app/settings/api-keys. Without this set, Tink-on
# falls back to its local Web Audio synth automatically.
ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=
